# PLACEHOLDER - replace with the real root CA before running `puppet apply`.
#
# brooke-pki is private, so Puppet cannot download this at apply time.
# Copy it from your local checkout:
#
#   cp ~/brooke-pki/certificates/brookemao-root-ca-1.pem \
#      modules/homelab/files/brookemao-root-ca-1.pem
#
# Source: https://github.com/brookemao/brooke-pki/blob/main/certificates/brookemao-root-ca-1.pem
# The file must be a PEM bundle with the "Brooke Mao Root CA 1" certificate
# used to verify nginx mTLS client certificates for cockpit.brookemao.ca.
